  "content": "<p data-pid=\"4r8U744-\">……<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/ScienceAndRationalitySequence\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">「科学与理性」</a>系列以及文章<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/ATechnicalExplanationOfTechnicalExplanation\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《对技术解释的技术解释》</a>将这些理念融会贯通，并将其与科学实践结合起来。</p><p data-pid=\"FcMm1Y-_\">—Rob Bensinger，<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/TheWorldAnIntroduction\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">​​《世界：导读》</a><sup data-text=\"世界：导读\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2064705136883245583\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"1\">[1]</sup></p><hr/><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2100905602411251643\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"旧世代科学的失败\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ba355c78b7f56fe8343d7da740cbc799.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">旧世代科学的失败</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2101247086901706984\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"困境：科学还是贝叶斯？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-78afa2ef397cf886fe053d8f4d6bd65d.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">困境：科学还是贝叶斯？</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2101621172253234659\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"科学不相信你的理性\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b4574e1f695e9c401b459543bc950b64.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">科学不相信你的理性</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2102059193201058456\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"当科学无能为力时\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-b0cad318820d2b50e19ca7c7836ac8a5.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">当科学无能为力时</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2102468203410735218\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"科学还不够严苛\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ac1b495388e665fce12c5bd470e25e4b.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">科学还不够严苛</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2102876085436299063\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"​科学家已经知道这些了吗？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-0b7dd7b16890967b4002b0aecccad750.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">​科学家已经知道这些了吗？</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2103127852757546926\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"没有任何防线是安全的，科学也不例外\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-499407e765b2dcf5976c0c7674d002f3.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">没有任何防线是安全的，科学也不例外</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2103533031562789005\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"改变科学的定义\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e83e5f0ac06835ce11a17604ab5b2a6f.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">改变科学的定义</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2103877608198903500\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"比科学更快\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6148a422df10ca151764cdc86aa52a85.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">比科学更快</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2104226368514946084\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"爱因斯坦的速度\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-873a23fbab6546c840b5235ef429bae3.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">爱因斯坦的速度</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2104613351229863044\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"那条外星信息\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-640b9870cd3f16cec9e5c29700e98458.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">那条外星信息</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2104988719879033824\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"我童年的榜样\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-41ad87cee64b1267d8ae68d0d720069d.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">我童年的榜样</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2105410460992458807\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"爱因斯坦的超能力\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a6737fae191e887e952012a4f1ca4468.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">爱因斯坦的超能力</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2105722277195206942\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"结课大作业\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-26a4d425fcaf8e755cc6e101bbb554c9.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">结课大作业</a><hr/><p data-pid=\"-P0fMb8c\">总目录：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2056344770390373406\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3fef08abf83e7421c313574aac5dde16.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录</a><p data-pid=\"CQ6oFMJf\">卷：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2064365098970436713\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"第四卷：区区现实\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-28e9661e962caec2608202b8f2662d4d.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">第四卷：区区现实</a><p data-pid=\"9n4q5DQu\">上一篇：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2100227945059174170\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"多个世界，一个最佳猜测\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-90ac1f6c7d0daf66adfaa40f12792f77.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">多个世界，一个最佳猜测</a><p data-pid=\"0J8K8MIH\">下一篇：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2100905602411251643\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"旧世代科学的失败\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ba355c78b7f56fe8343d7da740cbc799.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">旧世代科学的失败</a><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"T3Un_VeG\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Science-And-Rationality-Sequence\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Science and Rationality - Sequence</a></blockquote>",
